+<span><span class="co">#&gt; [1] "saved: "                   "1-species_1_abundance.tif"</span></span>
+<span><span class="co">#&gt; [1] "saved: "                   "2-species_2_abundance.tif"</span></span>
+<span><span class="co">#&gt; [1] "saved: "                   "2-species_1_abundance.tif"</span></span>
+<span><span class="co">#&gt; [1] "saved: "                   "3-species_2_abundance.tif"</span></span>
+<span><span class="co">#&gt; [1] "saved: "                   "3-species_1_abundance.tif"</span></span></code></pre></div>
+<p>Now delete the files again. Don’t do this if you actually want to
